11	// retrieve_cmd.go wires the qmd-aligned verbs over the unified text index:
12	// search (lexical), vsearch (vector), query (hybrid), and get/multi-get (fetch by
13	// id). These verbs subsumed the old per-source inspect kinds (facts/docs/history
14	// text). What remains under `inspect` is only what the verbs can't do: symbol-graph
